OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,CToday:FMany places dry, but often      
OL,6,Fcloudy, although some bright or sunny  
OL,7,Fspells will occur. Scattered showers   
OL,8,Fthis morning along the south coast,    
OL,9,Fsometimes heavy with a chance of hail  
OL,10,Fand thunder. Later scattered showers   
OL,11,Farrive across western areas.           
OL,13,CTonight:FGenerally cloudy with showers 
OL,14,For longer spells of rain, although     
OL,15,Fsome drier spells are possible,        
OL,16,Fespecially across the southeast. Any   
OL,17,Fclear spells will lead to patchy mist  
OL,18,Fand fog forming.                       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
