OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,CFriday:FLargely cloudy morning with    
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain slowly moving away   
OL,7,Fsouthwards. Drier conditions will      
OL,8,Ffollow, along with possibly bright or  
OL,9,Fsunny spells for some areas.           
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry    
OL,12,Fand often cloudy, although some bright 
OL,13,For sunny spells will occur. Frosty     
OL,14,Fstart for many places Saturday.        
OL,15,FTemperatures near or slightly below    
OL,16,Fnormal.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
